Hi,
 
When roxygen founds a replacement method like "[<-.XXX", it tries to write to disk a file named "[<-.XXX.Rd", which fails on windows as "<" is not an accepted character in filenames. Is there a solution or workaround?
 
I'm using the Rforge development version of Roxygen built on 2009-01-29, under R 2.8.1 & Windows XP.
 
Thanks!
 
Enrique
 
